  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Clearance of Somalia&apos;s Arrears to the International Monetary Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to support stabilization and development in Somalia through reinforcement of the financial underpinnings of the exercise of core government functions at the central and decentral level. 
Contributions from a number of donores to clearing Somalia&apos;s arrears to the IMF ensures Somalia renewed access to financial support from the IMF, the World Bank and the African Development Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
